{
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderLetter-11380": "JUNA: 嗯？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderLetter-11381": "JUNA: 嘿，亚历？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderLetter-11382": "ALEXANDRA: 这是……一封信？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderLetter-11383": "ALEXANDRA: 我们飞这么高，应该不是碰巧吹进来的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderLetter-11384": "JUNA: 上面肯定有悬浮法术，可我感觉不到。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderLetter-11385": "JUNA: 也许用的不是风元素？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderLetter-11386": "ALEXANDRA: 我看不懂。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderLetter-11387": "ALEXANDRA: 这套字母看着很古老……还很凶。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderLetter-11388": "ALEXANDRA: 肯定是给那位军人的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderQuestWarps-11389": "GLUHENDER: 要进入格吕亨德任务的哪一段？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderQuestWarps-11390": "滑稽朱娜",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderQuestWarps-11391": "飞空艇来信",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderQuestWarps-11392": "跳跃虫",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderQuestWarps-11393": "尼古拉读信",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderQuestWarps-11394": "洞穴入口",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderQuestWarps-11395": "草原",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderQuestWarps-11396": "星界石阵 2",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderQuestWarps-11397": "齐卡隆谜题",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderQuestWarps-11398": "图书馆谜题",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderQuestWarps-11399": "最后的石阵",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderQuestWarps-11400": "迎战格吕亨德！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderQuestWarps-11401": "风之守卫",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderQuestWarps-11402": "火之守卫",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderQuestWarps-11403": "水之守卫",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderQuestWarps-11404": "地之守卫",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderQuestWarps-11405": "棱镜",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderQuestWarps-11406": "地堡",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderQuestWarps-11407": "梦境原野",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderQuestWarps-11408": "离开这里",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikolaiBekkerLetter-11409": "ALEXANDRA: 那个……有封信，好像是给你的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikolaiBekkerLetter-11410": "NIKOLAI: 奥斯伦语？我看看。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikolaiBekkerLetter-11411": "NIKOLAI: 贝克医生寄来的，说他们收到了一份相当惊人的报告。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikolaiBekkerLetter-11412": "CORDELIA: 什么意思？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikolaiBekkerLetter-11413": "NIKOLAI: 奥斯伦军队撤出斯特拉尔前，雷津抵抗组织的人偷走了一份奥斯伦情报档案。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikolaiBekkerLetter-11414": "NIKOLAI: 里面有个地堡计划，准备建座地下要塞，让总理的死忠在战后继续顽抗。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikolaiBekkerLetter-11415": "JEROME: 你确定是那位……贝克寄来的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikolaiBekkerLetter-11416": "NIKOLAI: 是他的笔迹。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikolaiBekkerLetter-11417": "NIKOLAI: 信里还特意用了几句他的惯用话，他知道我一看就能认出来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikolaiBekkerLetter-11418": "AGATA: 还是一股陷阱的味道。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikolaiBekkerLetter-11419": "NIKOLAI: 可不是。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikolaiBekkerLetter-11420": "CORDELIA: 该亲自看看，不能留下让战犯逃进去的据点。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikolaiBekkerLetter-11421": "NIKOLAI: 报告说，地堡在我那个世界东北方的一座岛上，那里群山环绕。我们得找一个洞口。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluCaveExpo-11422": "NIKOLAI: 没有绊线，也没有新的脚印。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluCaveExpo-11423": "NIKOLAI: 也许还没来得及躲进来，就被卢斯基亚人截住了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluCaveExpo-11424": "AGATA: 没有像大门的东西，也没有炸药。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluCaveExpo-11425": "CORDELIA: 我的侦测术也没发现什么。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluCaveExpo-11426": "JEROME: 我这边也一样。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluCaveExpo-11427": "ALEXANDRA: 闻到什么了吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluCaveExpo-11428": "JUNA: 没有。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluCaveExpo-11429": "JEROME: 就算用了无声警戒结界，也总得派人出来对付我们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluCaveExpo-11430": "CORDELIA: 亲爱的，能察觉地下有什么吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluCaveExpo-11431": "ALEXANDRA: 下面应该还有个更大的洞，大得多。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluCaveExpo-11432": "ALEXANDRA: 可我看不清，只能感觉到边缘。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluCaveExpo-11433": "CORDELIA: 深处也许有防止窥探的屏障。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluCaveExpo-11434": "NIKOLAI: 总挡不住炸药。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluCaveExpo-11435": "NIKOLAI: 找到入口，看看要多少才能炸开。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderPit-11436": "NIKOLAI: 嗯，就是入口。至少是其中一个。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderPit-11437": "AGATA: 有气流通往别的出口吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderPit-11438": "JUNA: 没有，空气基本不动……闻着就是潮湿老山洞的味道。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderPit-11439": "NIKOLAI: 没必要下去。要么烧一大堆火耗掉氧气，要么直接扔炸药。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderPit-11440": "JUNA: 等等，空气有点变化。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderPit-11441": "JUNA: 没有风吹过来了……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderPit-11442": "<align=\"center\">快跟上，朱娜。</align>",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderPit-11443": "JUNA: 嗯？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderPit-11444": "????: 知道你累，可得快点。现在追猎我们的不止一只了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderPit-11445": "????: 安阔他们就在前面。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderPit-11446": "JUNA: 好……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-innaqNPC-11447": "INNAQ: 别管我，我没事，你去追上乌贾尔和安阔。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-innaqNPC-11448": "INNAQ: 我在听风，看看有没有别的族群逃进森林。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-euruGathering1-11449": "ANQUO: 朱娜，得跟紧，它们就爱挑落单的下手。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-euruGathering1-11450": "UJAR: 进森林之前，我们六个在一起，也没见它们不敢来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-euruGathering1-11451": "INNAQ: 到底有几只？猛禽通常不会成群捕猎。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-euruGathering1-11452": "UJAR: 这些会。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-euruGathering1-11453": "ANQUO: 三只一起扑上来，几分钟就把阿纳吉撕碎了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-euruGathering1-11454": "ANQUO: 可即使那样，它们每次也只现形几秒。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-euruGathering1-11455": "UJAR: 那种隐形魔法……我从没……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-euruGathering1-11456": "INNAQ: 离平原只剩两天路了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-euruGathering1-11457": "UJAR: 现在怎么敢离开掩护？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-euruGathering1-11458": "ANQUO: 这里的草料不够，尤其等奥杜娅生下孩子以后……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-euruGathering1-11459": "JUNA: 奥杜娅……你还好吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-euruGathering1-11460": "ODUJA: 我没法每天都走这么远。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-euruGathering1-11461": "ODUJA: 等孩子生下来……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-euruGathering1-11462": "JUNA: 还有多久？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-euruGathering1-11463": "ODUJA: 两周？也许三周吧，我也不确定……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-euruGathering1-11464": "JUNA: 嗯？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-euruGathering1-11465": "JUNA: 等等！等等我！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-euruGathering1-11466": "JUNA: 等等！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-innaqNPC2-11467": "INNAQ: 得快点。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-innaqNPC2-11468": "INNAQ: 御风猎手不喜欢雨里捕猎，可这阵雨很快就过去了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-innaqNPC2-11469": "INNAQ: 找找奥杜娅，我听见她的叫声从风里传来……还有另一个声音。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-odujaWounded-11470": "JUNA: 奥杜娅！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-odujaWounded-11471": "JUNA: 奥杜娅！怎么……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-odujaWounded-11472": "JUNA: 怎么了？你受伤了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-odujaWounded-11473": "JUNA: 伤口不太深，能治好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-odujaWounded-11474": "ODUJA: 它们带走了她……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-odujaWounded-11475": "JUNA: 能站起来吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-odujaWounded-11476": "ODUJA: 它们带走了我的孩子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-odujaWounded-11477": "JUNA: 我们找其他人来……等等，什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-odujaWounded-11478": "ODUJA: 它们盘旋在我头顶，等着孩子出生……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-odujaWounded-11479": "ODUJA: 她才活了几分钟，它们就……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-odujaWounded-11480": "JUNA: 怎么……能……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-odujaWounded-11481": "JUNA: 不，这是噩梦……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-odujaWounded-11482": "UJAR: 朱娜，得继续走了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-odujaWounded-11483": "JUNA: 什么？我不会丢下她！你疯了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-odujaWounded-11484": "UJAR: 雨快停了，必须接着跑！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-odujaWounded-11485": "UJAR: 她站得起来就走，站不起来也没办法！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-odujaWounded-11486": "JUNA: 不！我不会这么做！你也绝不会说这种话！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-odujaWounded-11487": "UJAR: 没时间争这个，快走！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-odujaWounded-11488": "JUNA: （嗅了嗅）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-odujaWounded-11489": "JUNA: 那股硫磺味……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-odujaWounded-11490": "JUNA: 这真的是噩梦。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-odujaWounded-11491": "JUNA: 你根本不是乌贾尔。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-odujaWounded-11492": "JUNA: 你到底是什么生物？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-odujaWounded-11493": "JUNA: 这到底是哪里？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-odujaWounded-11494": "JUNA: 其他人呢？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexGluGlance-11495": "JUNA: 没有人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexGluGlance-11496": "JUNA: 要是刚才是别人的噩梦，那人已经走了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluAgataAlert-11497": "JUNA: 嗅，嗅……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluAgataAlert-11498": "JUNA: 上面是阿伽塔吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluAgataAlert-11499": "JUNA: 我可不会就这么丢下她……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-agataGlu1-11500": "JUNA: 嘿！你在做什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-agataGlu1-11501": "AGATA: 监视。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-agataGlu1-11502": "JUNA: 监视什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-agataGlu1-11503": "AGATA: 我们收到情报，说有危险。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-agataGlu1-11504": "JUNA: 什么威胁？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-agataGlu1-11505": "AGATA: 是个严重的威胁，今天，就在城里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-agataGlu1-11506": "JUNA: 好吧，你也困在噩梦里了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-agataGlu1-11507": "JUNA: 听着，这一切都是幻象，是某种……东西让你醒着也陷在梦里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-agataGlu1-11508": "DARIO: 别分心，他们随时会动手。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-agataGlu1-11509": "JUNA: 这家伙，他不是你以为的那个人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-agataGlu1-11510": "AGATA: 现在不是开玩笑的时候。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-agataGlu1-11511": "DARIO: 没错，集中精神。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-agataGlu1-11512": "JUNA: 也许别人能把她唤醒……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-stopJeromeSkip-11513": "JUNA: 我想看看，上面是谁的梦。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-jeromeGluIntro-11514": "JUNA: 不知道有没有人在……"
}
